      Key design decisions:

      1. Backend organized by feature - api/routes/, services/, devices/ separate concerns
      2. Frontend by feature + type - components/ by domain, pages/ for routes
      3. Separate Docker configs - Production vs development compose files
      4. i18n on both sides - Backend for API messages, frontend for UI
      5. Services layer - Business logic separate from API routes
      6. Tests mirror structure - Easy to locate corresponding tests
